<PolicyPage
  title="Terms & Disclaimers"
  heading="Terms & Disclaimers"
  description="The terms and disclaimers that apply to the Built West podcast and website."
  updated="October 12, 2026"
>
  <h2>Guest Opinions Are Theirs, Not Ours</h2>
  <p>Built West features conversations with founders, operators, and investors sharing their own views. We don’t fact-check every claim in real time, and guest opinions don’t represent Built West’s positions. Built West is not providing financial, legal, medical, or investment advice. Always do your own research and talk to a qualified professional before making decisions based on episode content.</p>

  <h2>How We Handle Corrections</h2>
  <p>If you spot a factual error, see our <a href="/corrections/">Corrections Policy</a> for how to report it and how we fix it.</p>

  <h2>Sponsorships</h2>
  <p>Built West may include paid sponsorships. Sponsors are clearly disclosed in the audio and show notes. Sponsors approve their own ad copy but do NOT control episode guests, topics, or our editorial positions. We make no warranty about sponsor claims — check them out and decide for yourself.</p>

  <h2>Copyright & Takedowns</h2>
  <p>Built West owns the copyright to all podcast episodes and website content. If you believe something infringes your copyright, email <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a> with your contact info, the copyrighted work, and a statement under penalty of perjury that you own it. We’ll respond within 10 business days.</p>

  <h2>We’re Not Liable</h2>
  <p>The podcast is provided as-is. We make no warranties about accuracy or fitness for any purpose. We’re not liable for: guest statements or claims; your decisions based on episode content; sponsor products or services; technical errors; or anything else arising from your use of or reliance on the podcast. You use the podcast at your own risk.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
  <p>We may link to other websites or products. We are not responsible for their content, accuracy, or practices.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a> with questions or concerns.</p>
</PolicyPage>
